#### Decision Variables

- $x_k$: integer, number of units of HiFi$k$ to produce per day ($k=1,\ldots,101$)
- $Idle_i$: continuous, idle time at workstation $i$ ($i=1,2,3$)

#### Complete Model

Minimize:
